efully about how long you\u2019re willing to risk staying underground. Every trip is a balance between greed and survival. Push too far, and you may not make it back.\n\nWith tense exploration, simple mechanics, and an ever-present threat, Crystal Game turns crystal hunting into a high-risk adventure where every decision matters.", "short_description": "Crystal Game is a cave-exploration adventure where you play as a monkey collecting glowing crystals to sell for profit \u2014 all while something dangerous lurks deep in the tunnels."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/crystal-game/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Shiva", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/crystal-game/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "25539757258987128"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818852_4448185935410117_3598088527280810839_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CmJVHn5uVLMQ7kNvwHYjtwC&_nc_oc=AdpHkcOtGGNLw13kY2vzg7FcWDpCz4AO0W7FwOGh7DkeFRj4KPVmLIfjzd6RSAsn5sw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRRUDfPty-KiDxgOK1EOBmgYyh09CTHlivz1dqhtG4miw&oe=6B0C4AF3"}, "is